  (description "Create error_report module with ProblemDetails struct: problem_type (serde rename 'type'), title, detail (Option), instance (Option), extensions (ProblemExtensions flattened). ProblemExtensions: exit_code, line, column, hint, source_name, source_context. All with skip_serializing_if for Options. Per SPEC-010 Section 8.3 and CON-102. Place in spindle-contract or spindle-cli depending on Phase C outcome.")
